{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-09-23T21:28:11.224Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"0be07b94b7b44e4ec913bc03","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-d6fd85"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Windows copied agent plugins cannot install pinned runtime through npm.cmd"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"CodeRabbit review on PR #1292 found that the new generated Claude/Codex plugin resolver calls spawnSync(\"npm.cmd\") without a Windows command processor. Node 24 cannot execute .cmd directly, so a copied plugin with an empty cache cannot complete its first pinned install on Windows. Preserve exact-version, atomic, offline behavior and prove actual Windows command transport in the required regression job."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["mcp","plugin-runtime","review-feedback","windows"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-09-23T21:28:11.224Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-23T21:28:11.224Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A copied Claude or Codex plugin with an empty cache installs its exact matching pm-cli runtime on Windows Node 24 through a safely bounded npm.cmd invocation; staging paths with spaces and shell metacharacters are preserved; generated launchers remain byte-identical; a native Windows regression exercises the command transport and required PR checks pass."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent",